<title>FINLAND: SILJA LINE OCT PASSENGER VOLUME DOWN 1 PCT.</title>
<headline>SILJA LINE OCT PASSENGER VOLUME DOWN 1 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry operator Silja Oy Ab said in a statement on Thursday the number of passenger carried in October by its Baltic Sea operator Silja Line fell one percent year-on-year to 473,713.</p>
<p>In January-October, Silja Line's passenger volume rose</p>
<p>eight percent to five million people, Silja said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p> Passenger volume (1,000)	    Oct 1996	 change yr/yr</p>
<p> Helsinki-Stockholm		    111,179		+6 pct</p>
<p> Turku-Stockholm			 176,289		-4 pct</p>
<p> Vaasa traffic			    53,076	     +20 pct</p>
<p> Helsinki-Tallinn			116,116		+7 pct</p>
<p> Finnjet				    17,053		+7 pct</p>
<p> TOTAL passengers			473,713		-1 pct</p>
<p> Freight units			    12,347		+9 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
